---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — HevaSEO"
  description="HevaSEO's privacy policy: how we collect, use, and protect our customers' personal data."
  contactHref="/#contact"
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: June 7, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-heva mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">1. Scope</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">This policy describes how HevaSEO (“we”) collects, uses, stores, and protects personal data when you visit hevaseo.com, leave your contact details, or use our services.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">2. Data we collect</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li>Contact information you provide: name, email, phone number, website/company name.</li>
          <li>Information exchanged during consultation and service delivery.</li>
          <li>Basic technical data: browser type, device, and basic browsing behavior, used to improve your experience.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">3. How we use it</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li>To provide consultation, quotes, and the SEO/GEO services you request.</li>
          <li>To send progress reports and notifications related to your project.</li>
          <li>To improve the quality of our services and website content.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">4. Data sharing</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">We do not sell your personal data. Data is only shared with the technical partners necessary to run the service (for example, email and hosting platforms) and when required by law.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">5. Storage &amp; security</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Data is retained only as long as necessary for the purposes above and is protected by reasonable technical measures to limit unauthorized access, loss, or leakage.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">6. Your rights</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data, and to withdraw any consent you have given. Please contact <a class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:hello@hevaseo.com">hello@hevaseo.com</a> to exercise these rights.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">For any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us by email at <a class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:hello@hevaseo.com">hello@hevaseo.com</a> or by phone at +1 (415) 555-0142.</p>
      </section>
      <p class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4 text-xs">Note: This is a reference template. Please review it with your legal team to ensure compliance with applicable regulations (including the GDPR and the CCPA) before publishing.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
